{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34383","headline":"闻袭美有亲迎之期因以寄贺 · 陆龟蒙","name":"闻袭美有亲迎之期因以寄贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁鸿夫妇欲双飞，细雨轻寒拂雉衣。\n初下雪窗因眷恋，次乘烟幰奈光辉。\n参差扇影分华月，断续箫声落翠微。\n见说春风偏有贺，露花千朵照庭闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}